## Level and limits

This proves the prepared fefw-recomp game build loaded and initialized all
three mods, reached the first frame, and created the plugins' settings files.
Quick Save reported that it could not find the game's save folder in this
headless profile, so no quick save was exercised. Turn Control registered its
System submenu. No save, turn, facility, panel or other gameplay action was
performed. The run was headless, so the panel was not visually inspected; API 3
has no panel capability and Trinity correctly stayed headless. The shutdown
timeout above is recorded as a runtime limitation.
